From: Itsnatch <kamaumark996@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 24 Jul 2026 20:46:23 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] Add retry functionality, rename payment-verifications to
 bank-verifications, fix employer wallet initialization, and improve
 organization linking

- Add retry approval button to admin advances with error handling
- Add retry functionality to employer dashboard advances with toasts
- Rename app/admin/payment-verifications to app/admin/bank-verifications
- Update AdminLayout route references
- Create employer_wallets for employers without one to fix PATCH 400 error
- Improve organization_id resolution in employer-promotion.ts with multiple lookup strategies
- Enhance error messages and user feedback with toast notifications
- Add loading states and visual indicators for all retry actions
